    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Door Before is a survival escape thriller where you\u2019re trapped in an endless, ever-changing hotel. Solve puzzles, collect resources, and escape the creatures hunting you. Run, hide, survive. Can you figure out why you\u2019re here or, more importantly, find a way out?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful but unsettling atmospheric environment. The hotel is always shifting, and no two runs are quite the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, and escape from a multitude of monsters and dangers. The further you get, the more aggressively they will attempt to stop you. Learn their behavior and use that knowledge to survive.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources and tools you find on your way to aid your progression. Manage them well, or risk getting lost in the dark.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets hidden in the dark recesses of the hotel. Maybe, just maybe, they will help you understand your purpose here.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Door Before is a survival escape thriller where you\u2019re trapped in an endless, ever-changing hotel. Solve puzzles, collect resources, and escape the creatures hunting you. Run, hide, survive. Can you figure out why you\u2019re here or, more importantly, find a way out?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful but unsettling atmospheric environment. The hotel is always shifting, and no two runs are quite the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, and escape from a multitude of monsters and dangers. The further you get, the more aggressively they will attempt to stop you. Learn their behavior and use that knowledge to survive.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources and tools you find on your way to aid your progression. Manage them well, or risk getting lost in the dark.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets hidden in the dark recesses of the hotel. Maybe, just maybe, they will help you understand your purpose here.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into a haunted hotel that will test your resolve. Run, hide, and use your resources to survive the dangers that lurk. Every attempt brings you closer to uncovering the way out, but beware as the monsters that hunt you grow more bold. Do you have what it takes to escape this nightmare?",
